  "owner_decisions": {
    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "summary": [
      "LYLA and LYLA-Education are two different projects.",
      "LYLA = LYLA Marvely and general LYLA brand content.",
      "LYLA-Education = all educational content, educational mascots, worksheets and educational series.",
      "Sheets titled 'Maskot LYLA Education' (Lyla solo, Lyla & Lilo) belong in LYLA-Education.",
      "Aisyah and Mama Aisyah belong in LYLA-Education (educational series about child behavior and parenting).",
      "Rico-and-Friends official characters: Rico, Lila, Bimo, Tika, Piko. Pip and Moss are NOT official. Do not create replacement characters or alter existing designs.",
      "Project/dinosaur name spelling is 'Rico' (the uploaded sheets read 'Rico'; do not edit the images).",
      "Arsein-Research stores ALL brand visual assets (master character sheet, primary logo, alternate logos, supporting assets); logos/brand assets are recorded separately from master characters. Do not alter original designs or create new assets.",
      "Logos inside a master character sheet stay part of that sheet; they are not extracted as logo files.",
      "FINAL (2026-11-17) Arsein-Research: all Arsein master characters and brand visuals live in Arsein-Research/. Primary logo = stacked/square version. Alternate logo = horizontal version. Kept as two separate assets. Default to the primary logo when generating; the alternate may be chosen when it suits the composition better. Arsein master characters must never be confused with same-named characters from other projects.",
      "FINAL (2026-11-17) The-Last-Letter / Maya: canonical (official) design is Maya WITHOUT hair tie or ribbon. If sheets differ, the no-ribbon design is the primary reference. Keep face, hair, outfit, colors, proportions and signature features per the master sheet.",
      "FINAL (2026-11-17) The-Last-Letter and LYLA-Anime-Universe are one universe; shared characters and story links allowed; no new characters or design changes without owner approval.",
      "FINAL (2026-11-17) LYLA-Education: Fasha and Kania are official characters; their master sheet stays in LYLA-Education/ and they must not be placed in general LYLA.",
      "FINAL (2026-11-17) Approval rule: never change original images, never delete or replace master files, never set 'approved' except for assets the owner clearly approved; keep hashes and origin notes."
    ]
  },
